# Split second (CR 702.61b) leaves special actions such as turning a face-down permanent face up (CR 116.2b, 708.8, the ruling)
# open to a player with priority. On turn 1 Bot1 has Turn Inside Out and Lightning Bolt kill its Llanowar Elves, and manifest
# dread puts a second Llanowar Elves onto the battlefield face down. On turn 5 Bot1 casts Krosan Grip at its own Mox Sapphire
# and, with Grip on the stack, turns the manifested Elves face up for {G} (CR 701.40b): it is a Llanowar Elves again before
# Grip resolves.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Llanowar Elves
Turn Inside Out
Lightning Bolt
Llanowar Elves
Island
Mountain
Krosan Grip
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Turn Inside Out.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Arrange(Llanowar Elves | Island)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield..FaceDown = true
Bot1.Hand.Krosan Grip.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire)
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
? Stack = Krosan Grip
Bot1.Battlefield.#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
? Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.FaceDown = (absent)
? Stack = Krosan Grip
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.FaceDown = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Power = 1
Bot1.Battlefield = Forest; Mountain; Mox Emerald; Llanowar Elves
Bot1.Graveyard = Krosan Grip; Mox Sapphire; Island; Llanowar Elves; Lightning Bolt; Turn Inside Out; Black Lotus
